t-style-type%3A%20disc%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20padding-left%3A%202em%3B%20display%3A%20flex%20!important%3B%20flex-direction%3A%20column%20!important%3B%20gap%3A%206px%20!important%3B%20margin%3A%206px%200px%20!important%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bli%20class%3D%26quot%3Bpy-1%20%5B%26amp%3Bamp%3B%26amp%3Bgt%3Bp%5D%3Ainline%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bstrong%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BWithout%20the%20lease%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%3A%20even%20though%20the%20Lua%20is%20atomic%20and%20prevents%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bem%26gt%3Btwo%26lt%3B%2Fem%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3BPickers%20from%20claiming%20the%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bem%26gt%3Bsame%26lt%3B%2Fem%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Bjob%2C%20you%20still%20get%20N%C2%B7256%20ticks%2F100ms%20%3D%20~2.5k%C2%B7N%20idle%20ticks%2Fsec.%20That's%20wasted%20Redis%20CPU%20and%20adds%20tail%20latency%20to%20legitimate%20ZADD%2FZREM%20operations%20on%20the%20same%20key%20(Redis%20is%20single-threaded%20per%20key).%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bli%20class%3D%26quot%3Bpy-1%20%5B%26amp%3Bamp%3B%26amp%3Bgt%3Bp%5D%3Ainline%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bstrong%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BWithout%20the%20lease%2C%20second%20risk%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%3A%20the%20produce-to-Kafka%20step%20is%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bem%26gt%3Bnot%26lt%3B%2Fem%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Binside%20the%20Lua.%20So%20two%20Pickers%20calling%20Lua%20back-to-back%20on%20the%20same%20shard%20might%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bem%26gt%3Bboth%26lt%3B%2Fem%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Bsucceed%20for%20distinct%20jobs%20in%20the%20same%20window%2C%20but%20if%20you%20ever%20weakened%20the%20Lua%20to%20a%20non-atomic%20ZRANGEBYSCORE%2BZREM%20pair%2C%20you'd%20get%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bstrong%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bdouble%20dispatch%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B.%20The%20lease%20is%20defense-in-depth%3A%20even%20if%20someone%20refactors%20the%20Lua%20poorly%20later%2C%20only%20one%20pod%20is%20ticking%20the%20shard%2C%20so%20only%20one%20can%20produce.%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bli%20class%3D%26quot%3Bpy-1%20%5B%26amp%3Bamp%3B%26amp%3Bgt%3Bp%5D%3Ainline%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bstrong%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BWith%20the%20lease%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%3A%20256%20ticks%2F100ms%20regardless%20of%20pod%20count.%20The%20100%20ms%20tick%20budget%20actually%20has%20slack%20to%20do%20real%20work.%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Ful%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bh2%20class%3D%26quot%3Bmt-6%20mb-2%20font-semibold%20text-2xl%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bheading-2%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin-bottom%3A%2010px%3B%20--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20line-height%3A%201.25%3B%20font-size%3A%201.3em%3B%20margin-top%3A%2020px%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B6.%20Why%20I%20usually%20co-locate%20Watcher%20%2B%20Picker%20in%20the%20same%20pod%26lt%3B%2Fh2%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin%3A%206px%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20