ta-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BThey%20share%20the%20same%20shard%20ownership%20decision%2C%20so%20one%20lease%20is%20enough.%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bli%20class%3D%26quot%3Bpy-1%20%5B%26amp%3Bamp%3B%26amp%3Bgt%3Bp%5D%3Ainline%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BCo-located%2C%20the%20pre-loader%20and%20picker%20share%20Redis%20connections%20to%20the%20same%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3B%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bdue%3A%7Bshard%7D%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Bkey%20%E2%80%94%20better%20connection%20reuse.%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bli%20class%3D%26quot%3Bpy-1%20%5B%26amp%3Bamp%3B%26amp%3Bgt%3Bp%5D%3Ainline%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BAvoids%20the%20failure%20mode%20where%20the%20Watcher%20lease%20holder%20is%20alive%20but%20the%20Picker%20lease%20holder%20is%20dead%2C%20leaving%20the%20ZSET%20filling%20but%20not%20draining.%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fol%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin%3A%206px%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3