0now%26lt%3B%2Fem%26gt%3B.%20Can't%20wait%20for%20the%201-min%20Watcher%20tick.%20Job%20Svc%20must%20produce%20to%20Kafka%202%20immediately.%20Going%20direct%20is%20the%20v1%20bug%20%E2%86%92%20use%20outbox.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bli%20class%3D%26quot%3Bpy-1%20%5B%26amp%3Bamp%3B%26amp%3Bgt%3Bp%5D%3Ainline%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bstrong%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BSubmit%20with%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3B%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bfire_at%20%E2%89%A4%20now%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B(immediate%20jobs).%20Same%20logic%20as%20runNow.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bli%20class%3D%26quot%3Bpy-1%20%5B%26amp%3Bamp%3B%26amp%3Bgt%3Bp%5D%3Ainline%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-s