0%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bfire_at%20%E2%89%A4%20now%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B(immediate%20jobs).%20Same%20logic%20as%20runNow.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bli%20class%3D%26quot%3Bpy-1%20%5B%26amp%3Bamp%3B%26amp%3Bgt%3Bp%5D%3Ainline%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bstrong%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BReconciliation%20%2F%20failsafe.%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3BIf%20a%20job%20is%20stuck%20in%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3B%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BQUEUED%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Bin%20Postgres%20but%20for%20some%20reason%20isn't%20in%20the%20Redis%20ZSET%20(hot%20tier%20was%20wiped%2C%20Watcher%20fell%20behind%2C%20Picker%20crashed%20for%20that%20shard)%20%E2%86%92%20some%20reconciler%20inserts%20into%20outbox%20%E2%86%92%20publisher%20re-emits%20to%20Kafka%202.%20This%20is%20the%20%26quot%3Brepublish%20(failsafe)%26quot%3B%20arrow%20on%20the%20diagram.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bli%20class%3D%26quot%3Bpy-1%20%5B%26amp%3Bamp%3B%26amp%3Bgt%3Bp%5D%3Ainline%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Blist-item%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding-block%3A%204px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20padding%3A%200px%20!important%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bstrong%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BJob%20lifecycle%20events%20for%20downstream%20consumers.%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3BBilling%2C%20audit%2C%20search%20indexing%2C%20customer-facing%20webhooks%2C%20etc.%20all%20want%20to%20know%20when%20a%20job%20was%20created%2C%20succeeded%2C%20failed.%20Those%20events%20go%20through%20the%20outbox%20so%20they're%20never%20lost.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fli%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fol%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin%3A%206px%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decora