0it's%20not%20the%20same%20dual-write%20bug%20we%20just%20fixed%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B(Postgres%20is%20still%20the%20source%20of%20truth%2C%20not%20Kafka).%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bh2%20class%3D%26quot%3Bmt-6%20mb-2%20font-semibold%20text-2xl%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bheading-2%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin-bottom%3A%2010px%3B%20--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20line-height%3A%201.25%3B%20font-size%3A%201.3em%3B%20margin-top%3A%2020px%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B1.%20The%20latency%20hole%20it's%20solving%26lt%3B%2Fh2%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin%3A%206px%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-we