D%26quot%3Bmy-4%20border-muted-foreground%2F30%20border-l-4%20pl-4%20text-muted-foreground%20italic%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bblockquote%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20padding%3A%208px%200px%208px%2016px%3B%20font-style%3A%20italic%3B%20margin%3A%200.5rem%200px%3B%20border-left%3A%202.91667px%20solid%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.12)%3B%20background%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bem%26gt%3B%26quot%3BThat%20arrow%20exists%20to%20close%20the%20latency%20gap%20for%20jobs%20whose%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3Bmd-inline-variable-like%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bfire_at%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Blands%20between%20Watcher%20ticks%20%E2%80%94%20without%20it%20we'd%20miss%20the%202%20s%20SLO%20by%20up%20to%2060%20s%20for%20any%20near-term%20job.%20It's%20a%20dual-write%2C%20but%20it's%20safe-by-construction%3A%20Postgres%20remains%20the%20source%20of%20truth%2C%20the%20Watcher's%201-min%20look-ahead%20is%20the%20recovery%20path%20if%20the%20ZADD%20fails%2C%20the%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3B%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BNX%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Bflag%20makes%20ZADD%20idempotent%20under%20races%2C%20and%20the%20executor's%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3B%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BWHERE%20status%3D'QUEUED'%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3BCAS%20prevents%20phantom%20runs%20if%20the%20Postgres%20txn%20rolls%20back.%20Worst-case%20failure%20mode%20is%20a%2060-second%20SLO%20miss%20on%20one%20job%2C%20not%20data%20loss.%20If%20you%20don't%20like%20the%20dual-write%20surface%20area%2C%20I'd%20replace%20it%20with%20a%20Debezium-driven%20promoter%20that%20tails%20Postgres%20and%2