ff%20interviewers%20reward.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin%3A%206px%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BIf%20this%20design%20is%20going%20into%20production%20code%20review%2C%20I'd%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bstrong%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bswitch%20to%20Alt%201%20(CDC-driven%20promoter)%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Bbecause%20the%20reduced%20cognitive%20surface%20area%20is%20worth%20the%20~100%20ms%20of%20extra%20latency%2C%20and%20you%20already%20have%20Debezium%20running%20for%20the%20outbox.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%206px%200px%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-sp