.91667px%20solid%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.12)%3B%20background%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bem%26gt%3B%26quot%3BNo%20%E2%80%94%20only%20writes%20that%20need%20a%20Kafka%20message%20published%20in%20the%20same%20transaction.%20For%20the%20scheduled-job%20submit%20path%2C%20the%20Kafka%20publish%20doesn't%20happen%20until%20fire_at%2C%20so%20there's%20no%20dual-write%20to%20fix%20and%20no%20outbox%20row.%20We%20only%20write%20outbox%20rows%20on%20the%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3Bmd-inline-variable-like%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BrunNow%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Bpath%20(where%20Kafka%20is%20needed%20immediately)%20and%20optionally%20on%20terminal%20status%20updates%20if%20external%20services%20subscribe%20to%20lifecycle%20events.%20The%20outbox%20isn't%20a%20generic%20event%20bus%20%E2%80%94%20it's%20specifically%20the%20bridge%20for%20transactions%20that%20must%20atomically%20mutate%20state%20and%20emit%20a%20message.%26quot%3B%26lt%3B%2Fem%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fblockquote%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin%3A%206px%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BThat%20answer%20signals%20you%20understand%20outbox%20is%20a%20tool%20with%20a%20specific%20job%2C%20not%20a%20default%20sprinkled%20on%20every%20write.%20Junior%20candidates%20write%20outbox%20rows%20everywhere%20and%20tank%20performance.%20Senior%20candidates%20write%20them%20exactly%20where%20dual-writes%20would%20otherwise%20leak.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bh2%20class%3D%26quot%3Bmt-6%20mb-2%20font-semibold%20text-2xl%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bheading-2%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin-bottom%3A%2010px%3B%20--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20line-height%3A%201.25%3B%20font-size%3A%201.3em%3B%20margin-top%3A%2020px%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BOne%20small%20follow-up%20the%20interviewer%20might%20throw%26lt%3B%2Fh2%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bblockquote%20class%3D%26quot%3Bmy-4%20border-muted-foreground%2F30%20border-l-4%20pl-4%20text-muted-foreground%20italic%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bblockquote%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20padding%3A%208px%200px%208px%2016px%3B%20font-style%3A%20italic%3B%20margin%3A%200.5rem%200px%3B%20border-left%3A%202.91667px%20solid%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.12)%3B%20background%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bem%26gt%3B%26quot%3BWhat%20if%20Postgres%20commits%20the%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3B%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bjobs%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Brow%20but%20the%20system%20crashes%20before%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3Bmd-inline-variable-like%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BrunNow%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3Bever%20produces%20%E2%80%94%20does%20the%20outbox%20row%20get%20lost%3F%26quot%3B%26lt%3B%2Fem%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fblockquote%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-space-y-reverse%3A%200%3B%20margin-block%3A%200px%2016px%3B%20margin%3A%206px%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-word%3B%20color%3A%20rgb(204%2C%20204%2C%20204)%3B%20font-family%3A%20-apple-system%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3Bsystem-ui%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20sans-serif%3B%20font-size%3A%2013px%3B%20font-style%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-ligatures%3A%20normal%3B%20font-variant-caps%3A%20normal%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%20letter-spacing%3A%20normal%3B%20orphans%3A%202%3B%20text-align%3A%20start%3B%20text-indent%3A%200px%3B%20text-transform%3A%20none%3B%20widows%3A%202%3B%20word-spacing%3A%200px%3B%20-webkit-text-stroke-width%3A%200px%3B%20white-space%3A%20normal%3B%20background-color%3A%20rgb(31%2C%2031%2C%2031)%3B%20text-decoration-thickness%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-style%3A%20initial%3B%20text-decoration-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BNo%20%E2%80%94%20that's%20the%20whole%20point.%20Both%20rows%20are%20in%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20class%3D%26quot%3Bfont-semibold%26quot%3B%20data-streamdown%3D%26quot%3Bstrong%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3B--tw-font-weight%3A%20600%3B%20font-weight%3A%20600%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bthe%20same%20Postgres%20transaction%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%2C%20so%20they%20commit%20atomically.%20If%20Postgres%20commits%2C%20both%20rows%20are%20durable.%20If%20Postgres%20rolls%20back%2C%20neither%20exists.%20The%20Outbox%20Publisher%20is%20a%20separate%20process%20that%20tails%20the%20outbox%20table%20(polling%20or%20Debezium%20CDC)%20and%20publishes%20to%20Kafka%20with%20at-least-once%20semantics%2C%20then%20marks%20the%20row%20published.%20A%20crash%20anywhere%20on%20the%20publisher%20side%20just%20means%20the%20row%20is%20re-published%20on%20restart%20%E2%80%94%20and%20the%20consumer%20dedups%20on%26lt%3Bspan%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bcode%20class%3D%26quot%3Bmd-inline-variable-like%26quot%3B%20style%3D%26quot%3Bpadding%3A%201.5px%204px%3B%20border-radius%3A%205px%3B%20background-color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.08)%3B%20color%3A%20color(srgb%200.8%200.8%200.8%20%2F%200.94)%3B%20font-family%3A%20Menlo%2C%20Monaco%2C%20%26amp%3Bquot%3BCourier%20New%26amp%3Bquot%3B%2C%20monospace%3B%20font-size%3A%200.9em%3B%20line-height%3A%201.4%3B%20word-break%3A%20break-all%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bjob_id%26lt%3B%2Fcode%26gt%3B.%26lt%3B%2Fp%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bp%20style%3D%26quot%3Bmargin%3A%206px%200px%200px%3B%20word-break%3A%2